{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"747916376987140289","content":"Aberrant Amber- Weapons made with this material cut cleanly and on occasion absorb the life forces of the foe and transfer them into the wielder. When you crit with this weapon you heal for half of the damage done. If you are Damned, you also bypass resistances and immunities and deal an extra 1d4 necrotic damage.\nShards of amber can also be grafted to the skin of a creature to increase their AC by +1. When you get this grafted onto you roll a DC 15 Con Save. If you fail you permanently lose 2 hit die worth of health, not including Con modifier or bonuses from features or traits.","created_at":"2021-02-04T00:32:02.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"806683453620748299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
